claim.claim-text:
receiving, from a base station, a time division duplexing, TDD, configuration of designated downlink symbols (240), designated uplink symbols (260), and flexible symbols (245), which may be switched to be uplink or downlink symbols;
receiving, from the base station, in an allocation of uplink or downlink resources an indication to switch the flexible symbols (245) to be uplink or downlink symbols; and
communicating with the base station based on the designated downlink symbols (240), the designated uplink symbols (260), and the flexible symbols (245) based at least in part on the indication.

means for receiving, from a base station, a time division duplexing, TDD, configuration of designated downlink symbols (240), designated uplink symbols (260), and flexible symbols (245), which may be switched to be uplink or downlink symbols;
means for receiving, from the base station, in an allocation of uplink or downlink resources an indication to switch the flexible symbols (245) to be uplink or downlink symbols; and
means for communicating with the base station based on the designated downlink symbols (240), the designated uplink symbols (260), and the flexible symbols (245) based at least in part on the indication.
